 "name": "Bruce Banner // Hulk: Gamma Smash",
 "notes": [
  "v1, Oct 28, 2026 (High Bracket 2): Bruce Banner draws cards early for {X}{X}; transform him, or cast The Incredible Hulk side from the command zone for 6. Enrage: whenever Hulk is dealt damage he gets a +1/+1 counter, and if he's attacking he untaps and you get an extra combat. Getting blocked, fight spells, Red Hulk, Iron Fist and Brash Taunter set it off. 12 Gamma creatures plus counter doublers (Doc Samson, Hulk, Strongest There Is).",
  "Bracket 2 guardrails: no Caltrops, Pyrohemia, Gelectrode, Cunning Sparkmage or Prodigal Sorcerer — repeatable damage on an attacking Hulk is a two-card infinite-combat combo. No Game Changers (skip Cyclonic Rift, Fierce Guardianship, Mana Drain, tutors).",
  "Staples (Sol Ring, Cultivate, Counterspell, Heroic Intervention, dual lands, etc.) are placeholders from the general collection — swap in anything similar if missing. A few Marvel legends (Kid Loki, Ka-Zar, Ant-Man, Iron Fist, Beast, Hulkling) weren't rarity-checked; easy cuts if they're rares you don't have.",
  "Professor Hulk is another Gamma option, but it's in the Avengers Assemble precon."
 ],
